  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SOCIAL COHESION THROUGH COMMUNITY-BASED DEVELOPMENT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDO of the proposed project is to pilot new programmatic initiatives to enhance social cohesion within an existingcommunitydevelopment project and concurrently develop a rigorous evidence-driven framework to measure social cohesion outcomes inthe context of a community-based development approach.</narrative>
  </description>
